Kinetum private validation kit @KINETUM_VERSION@

Purpose:
  Internal integration and CloudLab validation of an independently installed runtime.

Runtime linkage:
  Each run names an explicit disjoint runtime root. The harness requires
  kinetum-info --check --json before admitting metadata or starting traffic.
  No runtime executable, module, provider artifact, or public installer is
  included in this private transport.

Validation-only binaries:
@KINETUM_VALIDATION_BINARY_MANIFEST@

Host preparation helpers:
  scripts/dpdk_hugepages.sh
  scripts/install_trex_ubuntu.sh

Harness:
  Python modules: kinetum_validation, kinetum_benchmark
  Resource root: kinetum_validation/data/
  cloudlab/fan_in_edge_gateway_profile.py

Harness authorities:
  kinetum_benchmark/contracts.py
  kinetum_validation/engine/json_contract.py
  kinetum_validation/engine/runtime_release.py
  kinetum_validation/process/run_owner.py
  kinetum_validation/process/system_tools.py
  kinetum_validation/traffic/trex_remote_script.py
  kinetum_validation/version_contract.py

Packaging policy:
  Python bytecode, caches, and source tests are excluded structurally.
  Pip installs into the selected Python environment.
  Validation resources remain outside the public runtime prefix.
